eyes MD\" is a controlled medical device (generic name: program for general-purpose diagnostic imaging workstations, certification number: 302ADBZX00011000) under the \"Act on Quality, Efficacy and Safety Assurance of Pharmaceuticals, Medical Devices, etc.\" (Pharmaceuticals and Medical Devices Act)."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "md_logo.png", "id": "5998065973633964", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003260_5998065976967297_260827317627691552_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TYbryhavWOwQ7kNvwG5j07c&_nc_oc=Adl20oU80D3-9Ga8Ll_YFB9kyynTNIg4XGrAsn3oxOWASkQTyOZePKRiKRq55Wv-93k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftcCh8QFWmJ9Zz6XMfk3q3ZwdNKZYPfF05ftG1o8w4lwQ&oe=69A4304D"}, {"file_name": "md_cover_tate.png", "id": "2303415159832893", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974904_2303415163166226_7688600240374808365_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_lklAWV_J3UQ7kNvwEZAGJr&_nc_oc=AdngWLAm6g30hI8hKO1271XZjCwYQbnip4QcOiDEm-O6QVpS2MGlcQ8EbpDgbRlebuE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afvesfaoa0NVzaGU6F7I2bHbOXyhPvgxGnEkGP_2E4y_bw&oe=69A422AC"}, {"file_name": "md_cover_miniyoko.png", "id": "950325029433473", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031585_950325032766806_6345836855774372629_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5-E36VbbpgwQ7kNvwH3Yb1H&_nc_oc=AdmG0vE6LF7P5g_km8qnxgHPaEutBjLnvRarF3tK9_p8so1-95Oakyy_DAv-IAU-ZZ0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afs_6yqbSlxqnrDUqrRpgfr9HAiR3746cyEo86eeUyihYg&oe=69A4443D"}, {"file_name": "md_cover_yoko.png", "id": "773168277532939", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75223486_773168280866272_6988374572968566012_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tUToop7vh7QQ7